Summary
--------------------------------------------------------------------

Today's work expanded the research visualization pipeline by
adding new movie-generation modules that track the evolution
of angular momentum and halo spin during the MW–M31 merger.

These tools provide an intuitive, time-resolved view of the
dynamical processes occurring during the merger and will
play an important role in interpreting the quantitative
results produced by the analysis pipeline.
